  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jer-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_jer-integration_downloads.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"下载量\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jer-integration/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/jer-integration.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"版本\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/Janoeo/JER-Integration?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"许可证\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/KkzqnzA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/630863620842061877?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<h2>关于 JER Integration</h2>\n<p><em><strong>JER Integration</strong></em> 是一款旨在为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-resources-jer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Resources (JER)</a> 提供更强大资源计算与兼容支持的模组。</p>\n<p>为实现此功能，JER Integration 实现了以下兼容补丁：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生物掉落（添加由生物掉落的物品）</li>\n<li>地牢战利品（补全缺失的战利品表）</li>\n<li>矿物生成（补全缺失的矿物）</li>\n<li>植物掉落（添加植物掉落物）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当前的兼容列表请参阅“依赖项”部分。</p>\n<h3>依赖项</h3>\n<p><strong>必需依赖</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-resources-jer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Resources (JER)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>可选 / 兼容模组</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>兼容模组可能会有所变动，你可以在文件依赖列表中查看当前支持的兼容模组</li>\n<li>或者查阅 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.alasdiablo.fr%252fjer-integration%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">JER Integration</a> 的在线文档</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>贡献指南</h2>\n<p>如果你想参与贡献，可以通过以下方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">提交 Bug 报告</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">功能请求</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">提交 Bug 修复</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">提交任何有用的代码更改</a></li>\n<li>如果您希望捐赠，目前无法进行，因为我们没有 Patreon（或其他类似平台），现阶段您只需<br>前往 CurseForge 下载本模组即可！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>开源协议</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>源代码遵循 <a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 协议</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>联系方式</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>请通过 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KkzqnzA\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 联系我们</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>鸣谢</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AlasDiablo\" rel=\"nofollow\">AlasDiablo</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/liotamiu\" rel=\"nofollow\">lIotaMiu</a> - 原作者，主要贡献者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dadadodu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dadadodu</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/Safyrus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Safyrus</a> - 测试与建议</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\">所有贡献者</a> - Bug 报告与修复</li>\n<li>以及下载本模组的所有玩家！</li>\n</ul>",
